     <td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">risks associated with international operations, including unfavorable regulatory, political, tax and labor conditions, which could harm our business;</p> </td>
    </tr>

