     <td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">our inability to attract and retain key employees and hire qualified management, technical and engineering personnel, which could harm our ability to compete;</p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#xa0;</p>
