     <td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">our exposure to various liability risks resulting from past or existing employment relationships and labor laws; and</p> </td>
    </tr>

