     <td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Cash and cash equivalents at the beginning of the period</p> </td>
