  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt; text-align: justify;">For information regarding the share ownership of directors and officers, see &#x201c;<i>Item 7.</i>&#xa0;<i>Major Shareholders and Related Party Transactions</i>&#x2014;<i>A. Major Shareholders</i>&#x201d;. For information as to our equity incentive plans, see &#x201c;<i>Item</i>&#xa0;<i>6. Directors, Senior Management and Employees</i>&#x2014;<i>B. Compensation</i>&#x2014;<i>Employee Participation</i>&#x201d;.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;width:100%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 5%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt;"><b><a id="P1I7" title="P1I7" href="#"></a>ITEM 7.</b></p> </td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 95%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt;"><b>MAJOR SHAREHOLDERS AND RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS</b></p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;width:100%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
