  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt;">As of the date of signing of this Annual Report, we have a subscribed capital in the amount of &#x20ac;10,840,026.90, which is divided into 105,667,115 ordinary shares, each with a nominal value of &#x20ac;0.06 and 3,000,000 high voting shares, each with a nominal value of &#x20ac;1.50. Our authorized share capital is &#x20ac;25,200,000, divided into 320,000,000 ordinary shares, each with a nominal value of &#x20ac;0.06, and 4,000,000 high voting shares, each with a nominal value of &#x20ac;1.50. The following table sets forth information, as of November 30, 2023, regarding the beneficial ownership of our ordinary shares and our high voting shares:</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
