     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 97%; text-align: justify;">On April 21, 2023, Martina Buchhauser, Sebastian B&#xf6;ttger, Robert A. Jeffe and Arnd Schwierholz resigned from their roles as members of the Company&#x2019;s supervisory board and as members of the supervisory board committees, as applicable, with immediate effect.</td>
