     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 3%; text-align: justify;">(2)</td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 97%; text-align: justify;">On September 11, 2023, Martin Sabbione, Sandra Vogt-Sasse, and Thomas Wiedermann were appointed as acting members of the Company&#x2019;s supervisory board on a provisional basis.</td>
