    </tr>

    <tr>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 3%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt; text-align: justify;">(4)</p> </td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 97%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt; text-align: justify;">Torsten Kiedel joined Sono Motors on February 1, 2020 and became a member of our management board immediately prior to the pricing of the IPO.</p> </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 3%; text-align: justify;">&#xa0;</td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 97%; text-align: justify;">&#xa0;</td>
