    <tr>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 3%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt; text-align: justify;">(5)</p> </td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 97%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt; text-align: justify;">Thomas Hausch joined Sono Motors on June 13, 2018 and became a member of our management board immediately prior to the pricing of the IPO. In the context of the termination of the Sion passenger car program, he resigned as member of the management board on March 21, 2023, with immediate effect.</p> </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 3%; text-align: justify;">&#xa0;</td>
