     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 5%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt;"><b><a id="P1I12" title="P1I12" href="#"></a>ITEM 12.</b></p> </td>
     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 95%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt;"><b>DESCRIPTION OF SECURITIES OTHER THAN EQUITY SECURITIES</b></p> </td>
    </tr>

   </tbody>
  </table>
