     <td style="vertical-align: top; width: 95%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-indent: 1pt;"><b>Warrants and rights.</b></p> </td>
