   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The personnel expenses concern mainly employees responsible for marketing activities like roadshows, test rides and social media, and the share of the employee participation programs (CSOP and ESOP) attributable to them (see note <em style="font: inherit;">9.3</em> Remuneration based on shares (share-based payment)).</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#xa0;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;"><td style="width: 36pt;"> <p style="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">6.4</em></b>&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;<b>&#xa0;</b></p> </td><td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><b>General and administrative expenses</b></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The below table displays details included in general and administrative expenses:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
