   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Due to changes in the fair value of the derivatives embedded in the convertible debentures, an amount of kEUR <ix:nonFraction id="c105719028" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="EUR" name="ifrs-full:GainsLossesOnFinancialLiabilitiesAtFairValueThroughProfitOrLossDesignatedAsUponInitialRecognition" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">645</ix:nonFraction> is reported under interest and similar income. Income from currency revaluation includes exchange gains on the convertible debentures&#x2019; host contracts and bifurcated embedded derivatives.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;"><td style="width: 36pt;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">6.8</em></b>&#xa0; &#xa0; &#xa0;</p> </td><td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Interest and similar expense</b></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
