   <ix:exclude>&#xa0;</ix:exclude>
   <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;"><td style="width: 36pt;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;">7.3</em> </b></p> </td><td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Right-of-use assets </b></p> </td></tr>
</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Sono Motors leases buildings and warehouses at its headquarters in Munich and <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> electrical cars including batteries. At the end of the reporting period, the remaining lease terms for the buildings were <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31_ClassesOfAssetsAxis-BuildingsMember_RangeAxis-BottomOfRangeMember" name="sev:RemainingLeaseTerms" id="c105715164" format="ixt-sec:duryear">4</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31_ClassesOfAssetsAxis-BuildingsMember_RangeAxis-TopOfRangeMember" name="sev:RemainingLeaseTerms" id="c105715165" format="ixt-sec:duryear">8</ix:nonNumeric> years and for the cars <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31_ClassesOfAssetsAxis-VehiclesMember_RangeAxis-BottomOfRangeMember" name="sev:RemainingLeaseTerms" id="c105715166" format="ixt-sec:duryear">2</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31_ClassesOfAssetsAxis-VehiclesMember_RangeAxis-TopOfRangeMember" name="sev:RemainingLeaseTerms" id="c105715167" format="ixt-sec:duryear">3</ix:nonNumeric> years.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The below table presents details on the lease agreements of Sono Motors:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
