   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Deposits are balances held with the service provider that processes advance payments received from customers which were mainly received during the crowd-funding campaign in <em style="font: inherit;"> December 2022.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><br /> For details on expected credit losses, please refer to note <em style="font: inherit;">8.1.2</em>&#xa0;Credit risk.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
