   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> February 24, 2023, </em>the decision was taken to restructure and terminate the Sion program. For the effect of this event on future financial periods, please see the note <em style="font: inherit;">9.7.</em> Subsequent events.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
