</tbody></table>
   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The table below displays the gross carrying amount of other current and noncurrent financial assets as well as cash&#xa0;and cash equivalents by credit risk rating grades.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfCreditRiskExplanatory" id="c2526283" escape="true">
