   </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">Due to the small number of financial assets, Sono Group uses the ECL stages as credit risk rating grades. Risk class <em style="font: inherit;">1</em> denotes a stage <em style="font: inherit;">1</em> expected credit loss.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
