   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#xa0;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Sono Group had the following carrying amounts of exposures in foreign currency:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
