   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">Sono N.V. is <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> controlled by any other entity, but controls Sono Motors GmbH as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022. </em>In <em style="font: inherit;">2023,</em> there is a loss of control, expected to be temporary. See note <em style="font: inherit;">9.7.3</em> Loss of control.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">The below table displays the compensation of key management personnel:&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
